ity Rollup) built on top of Bitcoin.","key_features":["EVM Compatibility: Developers can deploy Ethereum-style smart contracts directly on Bitcoin infrastructure.","Strata Bridge: A trust-minimized, 1-of-N bridge design based on BitVM2 research.","Glock Protocol: A cryptographic standard that enables Ethereum-like verification efficiency on Bitcoin.","Bitcoin Dollar (BTD): A Bitcoin-backed, decentralized stablecoin ecosystem."],"value_proposition":"Allows Bitcoin to function as a programmable financial layer without compromising its core security or decentralization."},"parsing_json":{"company_overview":{"company_name":"Alpen Labs"},"problem":{"problem_statement":"The Bitcoin Meta-Problem\n\nBitcoin is the most secure asset, but lacks the native infrastructure for complex financial applications.\n\nLack of programmability (Bitcoin Script is too limited for DeFi).\nScalability constraints (high fees and low transaction throughput).\nPrivacy gaps for sensitive institutional or personal transactions.\nReliance on centralized or honest-majority bridges to move BTC."},"solution":{"solution_summary":"Strata\n\nA ZK Rollup (Validity Rollup) built on top of Bitcoin.\n\nEVM Compatibility: Developers can deploy Ethereum-style smart contracts directly on Bitcoin infrastructure.\nStrata Bridge: A trust-minimized, 1-of-N bridge design based on BitVM2 research.\nGlock Protocol: A cryptographic standard that enables Ethereum-like verification efficiency on Bitcoin.\nBitcoin Dollar (BTD): A Bitcoin-backed, decentralized stablecoin ecosystem.\n\nAllows Bitcoin to function as a programmable financial layer without compromising its core security or decentralization."}},"thesis_fit_json":{"overall_thesis_alignment_reasoning":"Alpen Labs — thesis fit (historical corpus, invested).\n\nProblem (The Bitcoin Meta-Problem): The Bitcoin Meta-Problem\n\nBitcoin is the most secure asset, but lacks the native infrastructure for complex financial applications.\n\nLack of programmability (Bitcoin 