roof de-risks Zavo's main claim?","structural_dependency_test":"Which single integration, partner, or regulatory dependency could stall Zavo if it slips?","market_contradiction":"What incumbent or substitute motion would make Zavo's wedge irrelevant in 18–24 months?"}},"questions_structural_json":{"dependency_chain_questions":{"weakest_link_verification":"Which step in Zavo's delivery chain (data, compliance, distribution) is least proven?","unvalidated_step_check":"What assumption in the sales or onboarding funnel has not been stress-tested at scale?","cascade_failure_test":"If the primary acquisition channel degrades, what is the fallback path to quota?"},"failure_mode_questions":["How does Zavo lose to a well-funded incumbent copying the feature set?","What breaks first if hiring or roadmap slips by two quarters?"],"conviction_delta_credibility_questions":["What would increase conviction in Zavo by two points on a 10-point scale in 90 days?"]},"pipeline_summaries":{"problem":"Small and medium-sized restaurants are currently forced to manage a 'chaos stack' of disconnected tools.\n\nFragmented Systems: Separate providers for POS, reservations, payments, and marketing that do not communicate.\nAdministrative Burden: Owners spend hours on manual reconciliation, menu updates, and staff scheduling.\nMissed Revenue: Inefficient reservation systems lead to missed calls and empty tables during peak hours.","solution":"AI-Native Operating System for Hospitality\n\nGiving every independent restaurant its own 'digital workforce' to handle the admin and operations, allowing owners to focus entirely on the guest experience.","traction":"Funding: Y Combinator (Winter 2026 / Fall 2025) · $500,000+ · Y Combinator\nBusiness metrics:\n• Over 400 businesses (restaurants and retail shops) onboarded within the first 6 months of operation.\n• Achieved 11+ hours saved per week on reconciliation for early adopters.\n• Reports a 32% increase in captured reservations for clients using their AI voice agents.\n• Standardized transaction fee of 0.79%, positioning themselves as the low-cost leader compared to Square and SumUp.","founder":"Can Zehebi — Co-founder & CEO — Serial entrepreneur with a focus on fintech and payment infrastructure.\nIlkan Gezer — Co-founder & CTO — Engineer specialized in building unified payment stacks and agentic AI systems.","assumptions":"Key assumptions for Zavo (historical corpus)."}}$j$::jsonb WHERE id = '1b000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009'::uuid;

