ull-stack restaurant technology, payment processing, and conversational AI (voice agents)."}}},"summary_text":"Can Zehebi — Co-founder & CEO — Serial entrepreneur with a focus on fintech and payment infrastructure.\nIlkan Gezer — Co-founder & CTO — Engineer specialized in building unified payment stacks and agentic AI systems.","founder_signal_summary":"The Zavo team lists 2 named leaders with complementary operating and technical depth.\n\nApproximate team scale / focus: 8. Collective expertise: The team consists of experts in full-stack restaurant technology, payment processing, and conversational AI (voice agents).\n\nPer-founder roster (summary):\nCan Zehebi — Co-founder & CEO — Serial entrepreneur with a focus on fintech and payment infrastructure.\nIlkan Gezer — Co-founder & CTO — Engineer specialized in building unified payment stacks and agentic AI systems.\n\nDiligence focus: verify prior operating scale (revenue / mandate), hiring velocity, domain-specific proof points, and cohesion between GTM and technical leads; cross-check claims against references and attributed public sources."}$j$::jsonb)
